===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|splocket}}

===Etymology===
{{etystub}}

===Pronunciation===
*: {{rhymes|ɒkɪt}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[tooth]]ed wheel that [[enmesh]]es with a [[chain]] or other [[perforated]] [[band]].
# {{usually|plural}} The tooth of such a wheel.
# {{architecture}} A [[flare]]d extension at the base of a sloped roof.

====Usage notes====
Although sprockets are sometimes referred to as ''[[gear]]s'', there is a technical distinction between the two: sprockets interact with chains, whereas gears interact with other gears.

====Derived terms====
* [[sprocket wheel]]

